        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> In other words, for `CmdAtom`, the action `<C-j>` is simply considered a programmatic exit\n\nIt *was* misclassified by accident, bc the entry `nvim_feedkeys(\"i\", \"n\", false)` is programmatic (missing the \"t\" flag), but semantically you *did* type `<C-j>`, so that should be treated as user-input. \n\nShould be fixed now. LMK, and thank you for the early feedback.",
